1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Vergentlin (Chana - Hana) Shapira (Treves) was the sister of her mother-in-law Julia Sapira (Treves) - both daughters of Matityahu Treves.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hana Vergentlin Treves (daughter of Matityahu Ashkenazi Treves) was born 1340. She married Schmuel Spira.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hana Vergentlin Treves and Schmuel Spira are:  +Schlomo Zalman Spira(Landau), b. 1355, Speyer Germany, d. 1430, Heilbronn Germany. http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/r/u/b/Leon-Rubinstein/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1746.
