1 OCCU Rabbi & Av Beit Din in Alsace, Av Beis Din "Ahrport", Rabbi of Heilbronn and Landau
1 TITL Rabbi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.atlasobscura.com/articles/over-3000-years-of-humans-exaggerating-their-lineage-on-family-trees '''Over 3,000 Years of Humans Exaggerating Their Lineage on Family Trees'''] ............ '''The Lurie fami
2 CONC ly tree, on the other hand, is generally considered the oldest, or tallest, family tree in existence.''' Although it similarly begins with King David, the Lurie family tree continues up to the present day and includes among its me
2 CONC mbers Sigmund Freud, Karl Marx, Felix Mendelssohn, and many of the kings of Judah. In fact it appears to hold within it almost every Ashkenazi Jew in existence, including many characters of questionable legitimacy, such as Andreas
2 CONC , a Jew who having converted to Roman Catholicism proved himself so devout that he eventually became Pope. ..... ____________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT R. Aharon was the first of his family to become known in the responsa literature by name of "Luria" (or Lorjo or Loria).  He seems to have been sent back to Germany where he soon was selected by the already well-to-do R. Shlomo be
2 CONC n Shmuel Speyer of Landau in the Palatinate, as a husband for his learned daughter Miriam.
2 CONT
2 CONT R. Aharon was mentioned, together with his father-in-law and with a brother-in-law in the list of Beneficiaries of the General Privilege granted to Landau's Jews in 1433.
2 CONT
2 CONT In time he became a highly esteemed, learned and wealthy parnas, dayan and honorary rabbi in various places in Alsace and possibly also in Hailbronn.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Dr. Paul Jacobi, "The Historicity of the RaSHI Descent", Avotaynu - vol VI No. 1 p23]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Av Beith Din Heilburn
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Rav of Alsace
2 CONT
2 CONT First of the family to be called Luria
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=10138&hilite=a076efc5-a419-472d-815e-258be03cb4d4&st=%d7%99%d7%97%d7%99%d7%90%d7%9c+%d7%9c%d7%95%d7%a8%d7%99%d7%90&pgnum=106 חבל הכסף]
2 CONT
2 CONT SPOUSE:   MIRIAM SPIRA - '''The following are the maternal roots of Miriam Spira that lead directly to David Hamelech - King David:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Miriam was the daughter of R' SOLOMON SPIRA and a Female TREVES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Female TREVES was the daughter of R' MATISYAHU TREVES (1325-1385), who was AV BAIS DIN of the town he lived in.
2 CONT
2 CONT R' MATISYAHU was the son of YOSEF TREVES (born 1305), known as "YOSEF TREVES THE GREAT." Yosef was AV BAIS DIN in Marseilles, Paris.
2 CONT
2 CONT Yosef's father was YOCHANAN TREVES ASHKENAZI.
2 CONT
2 CONT YOCHANAN'S father was ABRAHAM TREVES.
2 CONT
2 CONT Four generations later was SHLOMO YITZCHAKI, known as the famous RASHI (1040-1105).
2 CONT
2 CONT Continuing further back are: YOCHANAN HASANDLER, GAMLIEL HAZAKAIN, SHIMON HANASI, and HILLEL HAZADDIK.
2 CONT
2 CONT The NODA B'YEHUDA traced his roots all the way back to KING DAVID - DAVID HAMELECH who reigned as King of ISRAEL over 2000 years ago.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.maxpages.com/nodabyehuda/Aaron_Luria_1400s
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Yechiel Luria II.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of  R’Aharon Luria I ben R’ Nethanel Luria of Heilbronn & Miriam Spira   |         Yehiel Luria II of Brisk
2 CONT           Yochanan Luria of Strasbourg 
2 CONT           Judah Luria “the Physician”
2 CONT
