2 CONT Avraham  was born in year 1460.  Avraham 's father was Yechiel  LURIA  and his mother was Bat SHRENTZEL.  His paternal grandparents were Aharon  LURIA  and Miriam Speyer  SPIRA ; his maternal grandparents were Eliezer  SHRENTZEL a
2 CONC nd <Unknown>.  He was the oldest of three children.  He had two sisters named Bat LURIA and Miriam Dreizel .
