1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.geni.com/people/Awrom-Wetzlar/6000000121402023919?through=6000000008879242719  dies at an old age in 1711, having been married to Freudle, daughter of the venerable Josel Amorsweiler.  They name one of 
2 CONC their sons Josbel, in honor of Abraham's father and another Josel, in honor of Josel Amorsweiler. Even though this practice occurred over and over in Frankfurt, with brothers bearing two forms of the same name: Jacob (like Jacob a
2 CONC nd Jokel) or two forms of Naftali (like Herz and Hirsch) it still meets with surprise.  But this was what happened in this case, and Josbel died 13 Nov 1721, having been married to Bunle bt Aberle Oettingen seGal, and Josel appare
2 CONC ntly died in about 1710, having lost his wife Rechle Limburg in 1705 and re-married to his half- or step-cousin, Jachet bt Loeb Cahn [Jachet was a granddaughter of Roeslin Oppenheim Cahn Wetzlar, the second wife of Josbel Wetzlar 
2 CONC (father of Abraham) and Roeslin is either Josel's grandmother or step-grandmother].
