2 CONT
2 CONT Media: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Page: New Series, Vol. 20, No. 3 (Jan., 1930), p. 217
2 CONT
2 CONT Text: [From the article: 'Rabbi David Oppenheimer. Glimpses of His Life and Activity, Derived from His Manuscripts in the Bodleian Library' by C. Duschinsky]
2 CONT
