2 CONC 2.1641, is made by Magdelaine Levy, wife of the said Nathan Cahen "iceluy presently in Frankfurt for about ten months"; she signs in Hebrew: "Mindlen Levi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Act #796 [English Translation]: 04.02.1682, folio 18: Judas LEVY and Natan CAHEIN his son-in-law; Judas signs in Hebrew "Yehuda bar Eliezer" while Nathan simply signs his first and last name.
2 CONT
