1 NOTE {geni:about_me} David Dawid Dowid STRAUSS zu KNOBLAUCH: b. ? - d. 25 Sept 1703, Frankfurt am Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Details courtesy of:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://digital.cjh.org:1801/view/action/nmets.do?DOCCHOICE=258967.xml&dvs=1554639240635~317&locale=de_DE&search_terms=&adjacency=&VIEWER_URL=/view/action/nmets.do?&DELIVERY_RULE_ID=2&divType=&COPYRIGHTS_DISPLAY_FILE=lbi-copyrightn
2 CONC otice-01
2 CONT
2 CONT (C - Page 95)
2 CONT
2 CONT Dowid STRAUSS/STRAUZ 
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Knoblauch (his widow moved to the house Pfanne, i.e. the official residence of his first wife)
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Kalman STRAUSS (d. 23.07.1674) son of David
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Melhen (sic) (d. 21.01.1665) daughter of Mose SMUTS
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Gutl (d. 09.08.1678), daughter of Herts rot. Schild (sic)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Sejnhen (d. 21.11.1717), daughter of Ajzek ULF
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Zanwel, who died a bachelor on 18.05.1699
2 CONT
2 CONT - Awrom, who died a bachelor on 14.07.1708
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: grave next to son Zanwel (no longer in existence/recordable for cemetery project)
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. Information on father Kalman STRAUSS z. Knoblauch ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Plus burial details on first wife Gutl/Gudl, née ROTHSCHILD
