2 CONT Abraham, son of Josef Hameln, was not born in Denmark and as the second child of Josef and Freude, he should not be born as late as 1636, but I won’t have a specific date to offer until I can find documentation showing the age of 
2 CONC one or the other of his children (this is the family group Glueckl describes at length, where the children arrived so late, and she specifies how far apart their births were – none of which helps until we have a date to count from
2 CONC  – or to!)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.dutchjewry.org/genealogy/duparc/2602.shtml
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Hamel(n), son of Joseph Jobst Hameln-Goldschmidt and Freude Fradchen SPANIER to: Soelka Boas, daughter of Chaim Avraham Hyman Boas and First Wife
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Sara HAMELN
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Samuel GOLDSCHMIDT to:  Hannah Goldschmidt-Hameln, daughter of Chaijim Hameln-Goldschmidt and Glikl Glueckel Hameln
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.dutchjewry.org/genealogy/boas/95.shtml
