1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Die Familie Wolf" - by Ernst Wolf 1924 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fpe.ch/stammbaum/ see pg. 118 
2 CONT
2 CONT see also chart Lion Gomperz &Lob Oppenheimer
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ou Suesse Cleve Gomperz
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Süsse Cleve-Gomperz heiratete Jakob Cohen (Jakob Hannover), den Sohn des Leffmann Behrens (1634–1714) aus Hannover[17] --> Simelie Leffmann Behrens († 19. Dezember 1739 in Pressburg), verehelicht mit Jehuda Loeb Oppenheimer († 4. 
2 CONC März 1732 in Pressburg)
2 CONT
2 CONT ——————— The death date of 1725 in Die Familie Gomperz by Kaufmann is said by the author to be “apparent” but he could not read any name on the tombstone. The date of 1723 comes from Ettlinger’s Ele Toldot and is definitive. 
