1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Itinerant Rabbi in Ferrara, Siena, Sabbionetta, Viadana, Bologna, Venice, Padua, Modena, and Ancona. Served as "private" rabbi in houses of rich bankers. Author of Kimha Deavishona (Bologna 1540-41). from Shlomo Si
2 CONC monsohn, History of the Jews in the Duchy of Mantua, p736, Tel-Aviv University, 1977
