2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/view.jsp?artid=1017&letter=S Jewishencyclopedia]: '''Benjamin Wolf Spira''' [http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/view.jsp?artid=1017&letter=S#3358 #5]: Son of '''Jehiel Spira'''; died at Prague Oct
2 CONC . 12, 1630. He was for more than thirty years associate rabbi and director of a Talmudic academy in that city. Although universally respected his extraordinary modesty prevented him from accepting the chief rabbinate of Prague; bu
2 CONC t he took charge of it temporarily from 1629 until his death 
2 CONT
