2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/view.jsp?artid=2108&letter=A&search=auerbach#ixzz1MerrOOsB
2 CONT
2 CONT AUERBACH
2 CONT
2 CONT A family of scholars, the progenitor of which was Moses Auerbach, court Jew to the bishop of Regensburg, about 1497.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1519 Jews were expelled from Regensburg - Fled in 1519 to Krakow
2 CONT
2 CONT Note by Haya Rubin:  Please note that Moses is shown as having two sons, David Teibele and David Tevele.  These are the same and should be merged. I do not know how to merge them, please help. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==רבי משה אויערבאך מרגנסבורג וקראקא(מגזע התרומת הדשן והגהות אשר"י)==
