1 NAME Marem Méir Abraham /Zay/
2 GIVN Marem Méir Abraham
2 SURN Zay
2 _MARNM Zay
2 NICK Marem Meyer Abraham Zay
1 NAME Marem Zay
1 NAME מארם //
2 GIVN מארם
2 SURN זאי
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1560
2 ADDR
3 STAE Metz (Moselle)
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 NOV 1629
2 ADDR
3 CITY Metz
3 STAE Lorraine
3 CTRY France
1 OCCU Syndic, rabbin
1 TITL Rabbi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Meir Abraham, called Marem ZAY, trustee, °v. 1560 to ... ? (not in Metz), d.07.11.1629 Metz (Mb 63: d. 20 Heshvan 390), x 1) perhaps a daughter of Mordecai CAHEN (see CAHEN I), x 2) ca. 1605/1610: Peslé, remarried 
2 CONC to Hayem RAMBACH in 1629, died after 1672; Peslé is reliably the mother of Catherine and of Moses. Enumerated in 1621 (list, n° 62, with five children). [Faustini 481]
2 CONT
2 CONT Metz Memorbuch #63 [English Translation]: The humble, pious and honest trustee, the Haver Meir Abraham, son of Rabbi Solomon Israel, "for he attended the synagogue morning and evening and studied day and night. He was very hospita
2 CONC ble and his sons donated to charity for him". Died on 20 Cheshvan 3.... in Metz.
2 CONT
2 CONT n'est pas né à Metz
2 CONT
2 CONT épouse en premières noces peut-être une fille de Mardochée CAHEN, puis Peslé vers 1605/1610 --------------------
