1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mardochée Süsskind called Mardochée Israël, syndic, °v.1585, d.16.01.1640 (Mb n° 138), unknown wife who survives him, counted in 1621 (n° 32) with four children, in 1637 (n° 81), also with four children [Faustini 4
