1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Memorbuch #702 [English Translation]: "The dear Minkele, daughter of Rabbi Simon Cahen, who... did good to all, spun Tsitsit, left a legacy to be distributed to the poor here and to those in the Holy Land... Her so
2 CONC ns donated to charity for her". Died on Wednesday evening and buried on Thursday 16 Adar II 5472 [24 Mar 1712]
2 CONT
2 CONT Act #1022: 11.02.1687: Simon TRENEL and the widow of Isaac TRENEL; the latter signed: "Minqlen bat har. R. Shimon z'l". [Faustini 212]
