1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ellie Ellihe "Elchen" etc. ULLMANN ULMAN, née GOLDSCHMIED: b.? - d. 11 Feb 1794, Frankfurt-am-Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT "Deutschland, ausgewählte evangelische Kirchenbücher 1500-1971," database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QPFH-4KCD : 13 April 2023), Goldschmidt in entry for Löb Isaac Ullmann, 17 May 1829; images digit
2 CONC ized and records extracted by Ancestry; citing Marriage, Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preußen, Deutschland, , German Lutheran Collection, various parishes, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Ellihe ULMAN, wife of Itsek Josef ULLMANN, daughter of Itsek ben Josef Hameln- ... died 11 Feb 1794 "im Wochenbett" (sick bed).
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Leichte
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Itsek GOLDSCHMIED-HAMELN z. Flasche (d. 14.06.1784), son of Josef
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Gitle/Gütel (d. 05.05.1821), daughter of Lejb OPPENHEIM
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: on 3 Nov 1789 the divorced husband of Hinle (Henriette): Itsek (Isaac) ULMANN (d. 06.07.1822), son of Josef (as widower on death of Ellihe he then married Ester Ellise) "Deutschland, ausgewählte evangelische Kirchenbüche
2 CONC r 1500-1971," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QPFH-31H1 : 25 March 2020), Goldschmidt in entry for Töb Isaak Ullmann, 4 Jun 1829; images digitized and records extracted by Ancestry; citing Marriage,
2 CONC  Frankfurt am Main, Hessen-Nassau, Preußen, Deutschland, Frankfurt, German Lutheran Collection, various parishes, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT And also information on husband ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Itsek ULLMANN, "Handelsmann" died 6 July 1822, age 70
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) 28.07.1786: Hinle (d. 26.10.1829),daughter of Ber RINDSKOPF. (The marriage was childless. Once divorced, she married Josef OPPENHEIM).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) 03.11.1789: Ellie (d. 11.02.1794), daughter of Itsek GOLDSCHMIED-HÄMELN
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) 1794: Ellise (Ester), (d. 02.12.1857), daughter of ? SCHEYER.
