1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married Jachet Cosman Levi in 1763. He lived his whole life at 22 Thoemaestrasse Soest. The house was built in 1545, and Phillip's father Jacob Stern bought it in 1705. It has recently been fully restored to it's f
2 CONC ormer glory. It was still in Jewish hands until 1970, when the last decendent of the Stern family died. She was called Anna Stern, and she spent the 2nd World war in England, and got the house back after the war.
