1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Die Familie Wolf" - by Ernst Wolf 1924 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fpe.ch/stammbaum/ see pg. 118 
2 CONT
2 CONT see also chart Lion Gomperz. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT les parents de Jachet sont Issachar et Jutchen? il ne semble pas
2 CONT
2 CONT sur GenAmi 57 p. 17, elle est née vers 1555 et décédée en 1631 à Metz?
2 CONT
2 CONT sur GenAmi 41, elle est née vers 1550?
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT There are two Issachars who seem in the running to be Jachet's father, Issachar Beer Haas (died 5 July 1666 in Frankfurt am Main) and Beer Gans (died 19 August 1678 in Frankfurt). Beer Gans was married to Judlen/Jutchen daughter o
2 CONC f Loeb. Both have Ele Toldot entries; neither lists Jachet as a daughter. All we know from Die Familie Wolf & Die Familie Gompertz is that Jachet's father was Issachar (Ber). Juden in Emmerich seems to show that the father was Bee
2 CONC r GANS.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/90134960/person/74006463364 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 4 2018, 0:05:25 UTC''
