2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=102537748
2 CONT
2 CONT Peretz David Ballin
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Mar. 23, 1774, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Sep. 22, 1850 Hessen, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Rotenburg, died in Witzenhausen, the son of David Heynemann Ballin of the House of Levy (a Levite) and Jettchen Ballin (her maiden name).
2 CONT
2 CONT He had a brother Nathan (b. 1778), a brother Joseph (b. 1762) and a sister Susanne (1784-1845) who married Jacob Wertheim. 
2 CONT
