2 CONT [http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/articles/1963-ashkenazi-eliezer-lazer-b-elijah '''Eliezer ben Elijah Ashkenazi] (1512-1585) Talmudist, rabbi, physician, prolific author, many-sided and much travelled scholar. He was a leading a
2 CONC uthority in Prague,  Cremona, Italy, a rabbi in Posen.  In 1584 he left that city to take up his abode in Cracow. [http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/articles/1963-ashkenazi-eliezer-lazer-b-elijah  .  .  . ''More]
