2 NOTE https://winners-auctions.com/en/items/yosef-lekach-commentary-on-the-scroll-of-esther-by-rabbi-eliezer-ashkenazi-son-of-rabbi-eliyah-the-doctor-zl-cremona-1576/
3 CONT
3 CONT Auction 113
3 CONT Early Prints
3 CONT Item 93
3 CONT Yosef Lekach. Commentary on the Scroll of Esther by Rabbi Eliezer Ashkenazi son of Rabbi Eliyah the Doctor, Z”L. Cremona, 1576
3 CONT The author writes in the introduction that he named the book after Don Yosef Nasi, whose life story he also writes. The book includes the text of Megillat Esther (in unvowelized letters).
3 CONT Two similar editions of the book were printed the same year.
3 CONT Before us, on the title page: “Printed a second time.” Refer to Meir Benayahu, HaDefus HaIvri B’Cremona , 45, who writes that the edition before us is rare.
3 CONT 83 leaves, 19.5 cm. Meir Benayahu, HaDefus HaIvri B’Cremona , 45. Moderate-fine condition. Blemished title page, blemishes without lack on the two subsequent pages. Aging stains. Old, worn parchment binding.
