2 CONT Natan Nosson Natte Spira (Megalei Amukos) (son of Solomon Shlomo Spira) was born 1585 in Krakow Poland, and died 10 July 1633 in Krakow, Poland. He married Rosa Eberles Jakubowitz on 1605, daughter of Moshe Eberles Jakubowitz (Yek
2 CONC eles).
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Natan Nosson Natte Spira (Megalei Amukos) and Rosa Eberles Jakubowitz: Marriage: 1605
2 CONT Children of Natan Nosson Natte Spira (Megalei Amukos) and Rosa Eberles Jakubowitz are:  
2 CONT +Lifsha Spira, d. 1731. 
2 CONT +Yitzchak Spira. 
2 CONT +Chavah Dobrosh Freide Spira, b. 1615, Krakov Poland, d. 1642, Krakov Poland. 
2 CONT +Shlomo Spira, b. 1616, Krakov Poland, d. 1648. 
