2 CONT # R' Chajim Faubers TAUSK Sch.M. 55 
2 CONT #R' David R. Michael WIEN Sch.M. 55  ''Source: Extracts from property tax ledger, SÚA Praha, NM P-1/7/1''
2 CONT
