1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dovid Kahana [Shapira] b. Asher (ca. 1490-1560)
2 CONT R. Dovid was most likely the author of the rare Yiddish booklet אזהרת נשים , which was printed in Yiddish in Cracow in 1535 (or 1538). He is also mentioned in תשובות הרמ"א פ"א  , as well as  inסי' כ"ח ,שארית יוסף  . 
2 CONT
2 CONT His father’s name was probably Rav Asher, a descendant of חכמי שפירא, as indicated in ספר באר מים חיים by his great-grandson R. Yaakov (Zunz, עיר הצדק, assumes the father’s name was Joel. However, J. Dembizer in מפלת עיר הצדק disa
2 CONC grees).  Apart from a mention in the introduction and in a Teshuva of the famous שו"ת מהר"מ לובלין , no further details are known about this person.  
