1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hindele, °c. ? 1620, d. 26.11.1709 (Mb no. 671, "the former Hindele, daughter of haver Meir Abraham"); she corresponds to Anne / Aynée ZAY, wife of Abraham GOUDCHAUX the Younger, son of Goudchaux HALPHEN, and she s
2 CONC igns many acts as his widow (acts 1019, 1066, 1086) or with him as below on 14.08.1656 (3 E 2989) "Hindlen bat har. R. Meir Zeye": [Faustini 482]
2 CONT
2 CONT Metz Memorbuch #671 [English Translation]: "The eminent, pious, excellent and ancient Hindele daughter of Haver Meir Abraham, who was always helpful to the poor..., mortified herself for some years by fasting... did pious works wi
2 CONC thout a spirit of profit... lived uprightly... raised orphans in her home all her life. Her sons donated to the hospice for her". Died on Tuesday evening and buried on Wednesday 24 Kislev 5470 [27 Nov 1709].
