1 CONT aka: HALFANUS; ALFANUS
0 @N6000000003495148242@ NOTE
1 CONT aka: Elijahu Menchem Chalfan
1 CONT
1 CONT Issued Rabbinical opinion, for Richard Croke via Francesco Giorgi, in the matter of the divorce of King Henry VIII - in favor of it.
1 CONT
